WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.460
Two days after surgery, remove the head bandage.

2
00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.020
Then check:

3
00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.380
is there tape over the incision behind your

4
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:08.860
ear?

5
00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:10.660
If there is tape —

6
00:00:10.708 --> 00:00:13.060
keep the area dry until three days after

7
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:15.620
surgery, and do not clean it before then.

8
00:00:15.913 --> 00:00:17.780
If there is no tape —

9
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:20.420
clean the edges gently twice a day with

10
00:00:20.473 --> 00:00:24.500
equal parts hydrogen peroxide and distilled water, then

11
00:00:24.553 --> 00:00:27.860
apply an antibiotic ointment such as bacitracin.
